// Each list holds the files of that program that failed its check when the
// programs were introduced. Their errors are tolerated there; the combined
// program, tsconfig.typecheck.json, which has both DOM and Node, still checks
// them in full.
//
// These lists may only shrink. Never add a file to make a new error pass:
// move the code to the environment that has the API, or write it with APIs
// both environments have. When a listed file stops failing, the check fails
// until the file is removed from its list.
